          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Rejoices? (मोदते, modate.) Salutes? (वन्दते, vandate.) Begs? (याचते, yācate.) Speaks? (भाषते, bhāṣate.) Shines? (शोभते, śobhate.) Points out? (सूचयति, sūcayati.) Digs? (खनति, khanati.) Sows? (वपति, vapati.) Is alive? (जीवति, jīvati.) Heats? (तपति, tapati.) Forgives? (क्षमते, kṣamate.) Blames? (निन्दति, nindati.) Praises? (प्रशंसति, praśaṁsati.) Accepts? (स्वीकरोति, svīkaroti.) Blossoms? (विकसति, vikasati.) Sinks? (मज्जति, majjati.) Bathes? (स्नाति, snāti.) Frolics? (खेलति, khelati.) Shuts? (निमीलयति, nimīlayati.) Opens? (उन्मीलयति, unmīlayati.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
