              "text": "Gambles? (दीव्यति, dīvyati.) Flows? (प्रवहति, pravahati.) Tastes? (आस्वादयति, āsvādayati.) Advises? (उपदिशति, upadiśati.) Honours? (सम्मानयति, sammānayati.) A household? (परिवारः, parivāraḥ.) A relative? (बन्धुः, bandhuḥ.) A companion? (सखा, sakhā.) An enemy? (शत्रुः, śatruḥ.) A neighbour? (प्रतिवेशी, prativeśī.) A poet? (कविः, kaviḥ.) A singer? (गायकः, gāyakaḥ.) A dancer? (नर्तकः, nartakaḥ.) A painter? (चित्रकारः, citrakāraḥ.) A craftsman? (शिल्पी, śilpī.) A preceptor? (आचार्यः, ācāryaḥ.) A head teacher? (प्रधानाचार्यः, pradhānācāryaḥ.) A pupil? (विद्यार्थी, vidyārthī.) A classmate? (सहपाठी, sahapāṭhī.) A doctor? (चिकित्सकः, cikitsakaḥ.) Exercise? (व्यायामः, vyāyāmaḥ.) Yoga? (योगः, yogaḥ.) Toil? (श्रमः, śramaḥ.) Tiredness? (क्लान्तिः, klāntiḥ.) A bath? (स्नानम्, snānam.)"
